# Optional overrides for the two destinations (e.g. staging).
# By default the portal links to the production systems defined in
# src/config/systems.ts (DEFAULT_DESTINATIONS):
#   Avaria  → https://takalot.vercel.app/
#   המחלבה  → https://luzly.vercel.app/
#
# TAKSHAL CTRL only links to them — it shares no code, data or auth with either.
# Absolute http(s) URLs or same-origin paths (e.g. /avaria/) are accepted.
# Anything else (javascript:, data:, malformed) is rejected and the entry is shown as unavailable.
# VITE_AVARIA_URL=https://takalot.vercel.app/
# VITE_MACHLAVA_URL=https://luzly.vercel.app/
